new file mode 100644
index 00000000..1eb01b85
--- /dev/null
+++ b/MOD.md
@@ -0,0 +1,63 @@
+# Readest Cloud-Sync Mod
+
+Replaces Readest's built-in cloud sync with sync stored in the user's own Google
+Drive (Dropbox later). See design + plan in the sibling repo folder:
+`../readest-gdrive-sync-mod/docs/specs/2026-06-18-readest-gdrive-sync-mod-design.md`
+and `.../docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-18-readest-gdrive-sync-phase1.md`.
+
+## Base
+- Upstream: `readest/readest` (remote renamed `origin` → `upstream`).
+- Branch: `cloud-sync-mod`.
+- Base tag: **`v0.11.12`** (rebased + verified 2026-06-20). Originally forked at
+  `ff96c6d` (~v0.11.4); the clone has since been un-shallowed (full history + tags).
+- The mod is now a **single squashed commit** on top of `v0.11.12`, so each future
+  update is a one-shot rebase onto the next tag (one conflict round at most). Full
+  pre-consolidation development history is preserved on `backup/pre-v0.11.12`.
+- Update workflow lives in `../readest-gdrive-sync-mod/tooling/`
+  (`update-to-version.sh`, `build-mod.sh`, the browser patcher) — replays this
+  commit onto a new tag, then builds.
+- Submodules initialized for build/test: `packages/foliate-js`, `packages/js-mdict`,
+  `packages/simplecc-wasm`, `apps/readest-app/src-tauri/plugins/tauri-plugin-turso`.
+  (Heavy Rust submodules `packages/tauri`, `packages/tauri-plugins`, `packages/qcms`
+  not initialized — only needed for the native Tauri build, not vitest.)
+
+## Upstream files edited
+NONE YET. All mod code so far is additive in new files (see below). When the
+binary-sync shim and DI swaps land, keep them in ONE commit titled
+`MOD: register drive sync provider` so a rebase re-applies a single localized hunk.
+
+Planned upstream touch points (later steps):
+- `src/services/cloudService.ts` + `src/services/appService.ts` — route book/cover
+  binary transfer through `DriveBlobStore` (CORRECTION: the Phase-1 plan named
+  `app/library/hooks/useBooksSync.ts`, but that hook does NOT call `libs/storage`;
+  the real `uploadFile`/`downloadFile` call sites are `cloudService.ts`/`appService.ts`).
+- (later phases) `context/SyncContext.tsx`, `app/reader/components/ReadingStatsTracker.tsx`,
+  `services/sync/replicaSync.ts`, `services/sync/passphraseGate.ts`, `types/settings.ts`.
+
+## Mod code added (all new files, no upstream conflict surface)
+- `src/services/cloudprovider/CloudProvider.ts` — backend-agnostic file API + types.
+- `src/services/cloudprovider/FakeCloudProvider.ts` — in-memory provider for tests.
+- `src/services/cloudprovider/GoogleDriveProvider.ts` — CloudProvider over Drive v3 REST.
+- `src/services/cloudprovider/googleAuth/pkce.ts` — PKCE pair + Google auth URL.
+- `src/services/cloudprovider/googleAuth/tokenStore.ts` — token exchange + refresh.
+- `src/services/cloudprovider/googleAuth/driveRest.ts` — pure Drive v3 request builders.
+- `src/services/cloudprovider/googleAuth/parseRedirect.ts` — OAuth redirect parser (CSRF guard).
+- `src/services/drivesync/layout.ts` — Drive path builders (book/cover blobs; Phase 1).
+- `src/services/drivesync/DriveBlobStore.ts` — book/cover binary transfer over CloudProvider.
+- `src/services/drivesync/cloudSyncContext.ts` — active-provider + blob-store wiring singleton.
+- Tests under `src/__tests__/cloudprovider/` and `src/__tests__/drivesync/`.
+
+## Copied helpers to re-diff on upstream bump
+- (Phase 2) `driveMerge.ts` will mirror `pages/api/sync.ts` LWW — re-diff on bump.
+
+## Rebase
+`git fetch --tags upstream && git rebase --onto <new-tag> <old-base> cloud-sync-mod`
+
+## Test/lint baseline on this checkout (pre-existing, NOT caused by the mod)
+- `pnpm test`: 14 test FILES fail to import (missing vendored artifacts: simplecc/jieba
+  wasm, pdfjs build; plus Windows path cases in node-app-service) → 4 real assertion
+  failures. Mod adds 74 passing tests, 0 new failures.
+- `pnpm lint` (`tsgo --noEmit`): 2 pre-existing errors, both `@simplecc/simplecc_wasm`
+  (missing `public/vendor/simplecc` build). Mod files are tsgo-clean.
+- Local test runs need `.env` (present) + `.env.test.local` (created empty, gitignored)
+  because `pnpm test` = `dotenv -e .env -e .env.test.local -- vitest`.
